222
00:11:08,450 --> 00:11:11,510
有时会出现相对激进的延伸
Sometimes you’re going to get relatively aggressive extensions.

223
00:11:11,510 --> 00:11:16,610
部分市场会在首次回调后激进延伸
Some markets tend to extend quite aggressively on that first pullback, after that first pullback.

225
00:11:17,030 --> 00:11:19,483
有些则会呈现更分步的走势如 E-mini S&P 500 例子所示
And some of them tend to give you

226
00:11:19,483 --> 00:11:22,856
a little bit more of a stepwise as we’ve seen

227
00:11:22,856 --> 00:11:25,309
in this example in the E-Mini S&Ps.

229
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:30,190
风险方面，我们在 95.5 区间做多
In terms of risk, we were long around that 95.5 area.

230
00:11:30,970 --> 00:11:32,837
现已将止损上移至 98.5——上涨 3 个点止损较紧的情况下获利 3 至 4 个点
We’re now trailing at 98.5—so, good three handles

231
00:11:32,837 --> 00:11:34,289
to the upside, three to four handles

232
00:11:34,289 --> 00:11:35,326
with a relatively tight stop.

233
00:11:44,425 --> 00:11:45,653
Of course, you can trail the stop,

234
00:11:45,653 --> 00:11:46,706
and you should trail the stop.

235
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:52,703
但同样，你也要确保别设得太紧，导致被止损出场在主动驱动结束前
But equally, you also want to make sure

236
00:11:52,703 --> 00:11:54,136
that you’re not keeping it too tight,

237
00:11:54,136 --> 00:11:56,466
so you end up getting stopped out before all the initiative is over.

238
00:11:56,470 --> 00:12:05,598
止盈方面，我会说：持多头直到市场给出离场理由
In terms of a target, as I say, stay long until the market Gives you a reason to get out.

242
00:12:05,598 --> 00:12:09,328
可以清楚看到在波动区间中
What I would say is we can very clearly see on the rotations,

243
00:12:11,230 --> 00:12:13,230
回调时出现买盘吸收
Again, buying absorption on the pullback.

244
00:12:13,390 --> 00:12:15,530
回调时再次出现买盘吸收
Again, buying absorption on the pullback.

245
00:12:15,530 --> 00:12:20,176
所以，如果突破某个区间比如在 10:07 前跌破 25.10我会锁定利润并离场，落袋为安
So, for me, if we were to take out one of those regions,

246
00:12:20,176 --> 00:12:21,605
say below this 25.10, by 10:07,

247
00:12:21,605 --> 00:12:25,894
I’d be looking to lock in the profits and get out

248
00:12:25,894 --> 00:12:28,395
and secure a very decent winner. Okay.

249
00:12:28,399 --> 00:12:31,656
这就是主动驱动的案例
That then is our example of the initiative drive.

250
00:12:31,656 --> 00:12:35,275
和往常一样，更新笔记
As usual, go and make some updates to your notes.

251
00:12:35,275 --> 00:12:37,808
再仔细思考一下
Maybe have a thought about it again.

252
00:12:42,180 --> 00:12:45,437
好，各位，本次练习到此结束
All right, guys. That’s a wrap then for this drill session.

253
00:12:45,437 --> 00:12:47,608
第 12 单元见
I’ll see you guys again in Unit 12.
